          ],
          "source": {
            "role": "MAIN",
            "name_full": "Ichi",
            "name_native": "イチ",
            "name_alternative": [],
            "description": "Member of the high-level Akabane Family. Although insanely strong, he's very petty and short-tempered, especially if people don't take his flashy technique names seriously or make fun of him. He also doesn't seem to mind killing other players at any given time - something which the Planet community strongly frowns upon.\n\n~!In the real world, he's a shut-in, living on terrible terms with his family - especially his father, whom he considers loathsome and irredeemable, and his brother, whom he assumes must be looking down on him all the time. However, he's a very skilled programmer, for example being able to create a program to bypass a ban with minimal effort.!~\n\n~!He hates when Aya is brought up in conversation, prompting him to have PTSD flashbacks and snap at whoever brings her up.!~"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 311492,
          "name": "Shiro Akabane",
          "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311492-xsU3K6v1mfNt.png",
          "description": "",
          "nicknames": [
            "Shiro Akabane",
            "赤羽士郎"
          ],
          "traits": [],
          "voice_actors": [
            {
              "name": "大塚明夫",
              "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95146-T6IEmqXW3xUN.jpg",
              "language": "日语"
            }
          ],
          "source": {
            "role": "MAIN",
            "name_full": "Shiro Akabane",
            "name_native": "赤羽士郎",
            "name_alternative": [],
            "description": "One of the members of the high-ranking Akabane Family. Due to being dependable, wise and strong, Ichi looks up to him as a sort of father figure, and the rest of the guild sees him as their backbone.\n\n~!He's actually Ichi's real-life father, as well as the creator of Planet. Although he's an extremely skilled programmer and tech genius, he's also a hopeless perfectionist who dislikes anything illogical, which often had terrible consequences for his children - most notably Aya, who was often the target of his scrutiny due to her timid nature.!~\n\n~!He blames himself for his daughter's death, having even gone as far as creating an AI replica of her in an attempt to bring her back and apologize for his mistakes.!~"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 311493,
          "name": "AAAAA",
          "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311493-COSEnEy93FAS.png",
          "description": "",
          "nicknames": [
            "AAAAA",
            "あああああ"
          ],
          "traits": [],
          "voice_actors": [
            {
              "name": "島﨑信長",
              "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n105989-96etzH1dLNug.jpg",
              "language": "日语"
            }
          ],
          "source": {
            "role": "MAIN",
            "name_full": "AAAAA",
            "name_native": "あああああ",
            "name_alternative": [],
            "description": "One of the Akabane Family's members. He's very friendly and cheerful, although not as skilled as the rest of the guild's members. He also remarks that he's not a very creative person, which is why he named himself the way he did.\n\n~!In real life, he's actually Ichi's younger brother and seems to have a successful professional career. However, he struggles to express emotions, which makes him often come off as cold and uncaring.!~"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 311495,
          "name": "May",
          "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311495-wBOPYOZeIKpQ.png",
          "description": "",
          "nicknames": [
            "May",
            "メイ"
          ],
          "traits": [],
          "voice_actors": [
            {
              "name": "遠藤綾",
              "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95054-8VgnlGK5QX2A.png",
              "language": "日语"
            }
          ],
          "source": {
            "role": "MAIN",
            "name_full": "May",
            "name_native": "メイ",
            "name_alternative": [],
            "description": "One of the Akabane Family's members. Although she's not very good in combat, she's an excellent healer, as well as the emotional backbone of the group due to her kindness. She enjoys peaceful side content in the game a fair bit, such as taking care of the flower garden or cooking for the other three guild members, even though she knows it's only a game.\n\n~!She's actually the wife of Shiro/Kojirou in real life, as well as the mother of Ichi and his siblings. Following the death of Aya, she would move out into a net cafe, where she's lived ever since. Her mental health seems to be in a very poor state - although she still cares for her sons and husband when she decides to visit their house, she seems to be largely just going through the motions without thinking much of her actions, repeating the same phrases repeatedly and often smiling in moments that don't require her to.!~"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 311494,
          "name": "Sasumata",
          "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311494-ytdZxlBgQL0T.png",
          "description": "",
          "nicknames": [
            "Sasumata",
            "サスマタ"
