          "traits": [],
          "voice_actors": [
            {
              "name": "七海ひろき",
              "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n151342-XKmi9w02EzHU.jpg",
              "language": "日语"
            }
          ],
          "source": {
            "role": "SUPPORTING",
            "name_full": "Sasumata",
            "name_native": "サスマタ",
            "name_alternative": [],
            "description": "Leon's best friend, a childish sidekick who often engages in wacky theatrics and carries his head around whenever it gets cut off.\n\n~!Their real identity is an AI, being one of many living within Planet's code as a result of Shiro/Kojirou attempting to bring back his dead daughter. However, Sasumata is the only one aware of their true nature as such, which makes them question the nature of their existence and purpose in life constantly.!~\n"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 311496,
          "name": "Shigatera",
          "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311496-0oQTzGKpUmef.png",
          "description": "",
          "nicknames": [
            "Shigatera",
            "シガテラ"
          ],
          "traits": [],
          "voice_actors": [
            {
              "name": "津田健次郎",
              "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n95591-WQGdD3ubbeoq.jpg",
              "language": "日语"
            }
          ],
          "source": {
            "role": "SUPPORTING",
            "name_full": "Shigatera",
            "name_native": "シガテラ",
            "name_alternative": [],
            "description": "One of Pico's subordinates, her serious and intimidating right-hand man.\n\n~!He actually never truly cared about Planet and deeply loathes every player around him, seeing everybody, including Pico, as mere means to an end, his only true desire being to get his hands on the prize money offered for capturing the Black Bird.!~\n\n~!In real life, he seems to be a failed musician, living in a rented apartment, which he struggles to pay rent for in time.!~\n\n~!Following his encounter with the Black Bird, he becomes stuck in an endless simulation, dying over and over again.!~"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": 311497,
          "name": "Pico",
          "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b311497-w2iUK5gSE17k.png",
          "description": "",
          "nicknames": [
            "Pico",
            "ピコ",
            "Sakurai Hanako (桜井花子)"
          ],
          "traits": [],
          "voice_actors": [
            {
              "name": "悠木碧",
              "image": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/staff/large/n101686-PTd0lQZMsmcv.png",
              "language": "日语"
            }
          ],
          "source": {
            "role": "SUPPORTING",
            "name_full": "Pico",
            "name_native": "ピコ",
            "name_alternative": [
              "Sakurai Hanako (桜井花子)"
            ],
            "description": "Captain of the pirate guild in Planet. A very arrogant girl who enjoys acting on her whims and prioritizes having fun above all else, often griefing and generally being a nuisance in-game, with her crew consisting of likeminded people who play the game to mess with others. At times, she tends to casually make wordplays that integrate her name into random words.\n\nHer only weakness seems to be a hopeless infatuation with Ichi, as the two had bonded over their loneliness in the past and, impressed with his chuunibyou antics, she considered him the coolest player on Planet. She tends to daydream about what could happen if they met in real life, thinking she would be able to help Ichi recover from his life as a shut-in and even fix him in general.\n\n~!She was one of the AIs made by Kojirou in an attempt to bring back his daughter, and arguably one of the more elaborate ones, being able to swap out at will between Planet and a simulation of the real world, as if she were truly an ordinary human playing a videogame. Her mind is a perfect replica of a deceased girl by the name of Hanako.!~"
          }
        },
